  - KUZPKG_EVENT_TRANSACTION_START, KUZPKG_EVENT_TRANSACTION_DONE
- database unlocking:
  - klpm_unlock()


API CHANGES BETWEEN 5.0 AND 5.1
===============================

[CHANGED]
- klpm_errno_t - added member KUZPKG_ERR_OK
- klpm_siglevel_t - value of KUZPKG_SIG_USE_DEFAULT changed
- functions using bitfields return/pass an int instead of an enum:
  - klpm_option_get_default_siglevel()
  - klpm_option_set_default_siglevel()
  - klpm_option_get_remote_file_siglevel()
  - klpm_option_set_remote_file_siglevel()
