  hash members
- klpm_question_import_key_t - holds key uid and fingerprint rather than klpm_pgpkey_t
- klpm_pkgreason_t - added KUZPKG_PKG_REASON_UNKNOWN
- klpm_transflag_t - added KUZPKG_TRANS_FLAG_NOHOOKS

[ADDED]
- extensible package data type:
  - klpm_pkg_xdata_t
  - klpm_pkg_get_xdata()
- accessor functions:
  - klpm_db_get_handle()
  - klpm_pkg_get_handle()
- cache server support:
