  - klpm_option_set_disable_sandbox_filesystem()
  - klpm_option_get_disable_sandbox_syscalls()
  - klpm_option_set_disable_sandbox_syscalls()
- Add missing accessors:
  - klpm_option_get_disable_dl_timeout()
  - klpm_option_get_disable_sandbox()
- KUZPKG_ERR_RETRUEVE_PREPARE

[CHANGED]
- klpm_pubkey_t - removed pubkey_algo member
- klpm_sandbox_setup_child() - added parameter to restrict syscalls
- klpm_option_get_disable_standbox() - returns 1 if any component is
  disabled, 2 if all components are disabled.
